    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Lissa Okoh",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100369250704577037721/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUnFgarBjiSv28tEGJP66Wrb-2LgyZ8eSKEFjh6WRCl8b7LQRU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "🌟 1 star - Faubourg de l'Île 🌟\n\nSo sad to see Faubourg de l'Île reduced to a ghost mall 😔. It used to be vibrant, bustling, full of life - now, it's mostly dark, empty corridors 🛤️. Over the years watched great boutiques shut down one by one, and I hope someone can bring back the magic ✨. I miss the old Faubourg 😢.",
        "time": 1766835122,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Gary Machado",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105547796614339530689/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUJWDp3MY_RJR520emno9rE8LdSLNEIEhD245gjj0foMhUcKun2hQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Only a few shops are left in this mall. Over the years it has failed to attract new tenants to revive the mall. Bringing a theater like Guzzo would've helped but that never panned out. The only stores I frequent is Pharmaprix, Dollarama, the delicious Pizza shop and the former Walmart. Been to Hart a few times in the past while the little ones were playing in the city's indoor play structure and was surprised to still see water leaks coming from the roof.",
        "time": 1575822918,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "David Olson",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112005128819375880196/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIEFRYG3vXf291f_hK9fXf8SQIWM3CQW7pKHshZXk_FNAwhQw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "I love this mall but what I think is interesting is the old Zellers has been changed in to Walmart but that closed so",
        "time": 1760924424,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Yan Lefebvre",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107439623616124099704/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUb2bEJWuMjFTuKPZJEhAstB9QtTD3DPzaMMY1de-YanPvHWcMq=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "This mall is worthy of a zombie movie scene.\n90% of the shops are closed or for rent. The floor tiles are broken. Some of the stores have a leaky ceiling with buckets underneath to collect the water. Its truly a sad place and there are no real reason to shop there anymore but it used to be an ok spot back in 2000",
        "time": 1754260477,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "kayden mayoff",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107865476333926860324/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUMd95CCpaZ_TI522ANiU_uLmgyDnGdxGd-_9vmHy6Kj1uqWb8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "The most underrated mall I know of. The place is completely abandoned which makes it a perfect place to roam around and enjoy the empty mall aesthetic. The stores are also super cool. These are stores that you would never find anywhere else in the same location.",
        "time": 1740946859,
        "translated": false
      }
